{"availability":"available","full":"gwilltsherman-byte/milovancroton","name":"milovancroton","description":"Free workout tracking for muscle growth, strength and calisthenics. Works offline, no account, browser-local data.","category":"Other","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-27T20:12:29Z","updated":"2026-10-11T00:03:39Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://gwilltsherman-byte.github.io/milovancroton/","topics":["calisthenics","fitness","hypertrophy","javascript","offline-first","pwa","strength-training","workout-tracker"],"demo":"https://gwilltsherman-byte.github.io/milovancroton/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:09.460Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:09.460Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:09.460Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:51:09.460Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Free workout tracking for muscle growth, strength and calisthenics. Milo works offline after the first load, needs no account, and saves your training data in your browser.","Milo is named after Milo of Croton, the wrestler said to have carried a calf every day as it grew into a bull. The app is plain JavaScript in app.js, with separate shadow roots for the trainers. security.js validates imports and protects HTML rendering. sw.js caches it for offline use, and manifest.webmanifest makes it installable.","Milo is a training log, not medical advice. Stop if an exercise hurts and seek qualified advice when needed."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/gwilltsherman-byte/milovancroton/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a1baad60a095e2d00b6b9a31928075a9cb8f09dd5a60b79836dd2ca24b3c9ab8","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:09.569Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:09.569Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Free workout tracking for muscle growth, strength and calisthenics. Milo works offline after the first load, needs no accou